# The maintainers' Ed25519 public key (base64, one line below these comments).
# /admin/update applies a release zip only when its MANIFEST.sig verifies
# against this key. Empty in a development checkout: generate a pair with
#   php tools/release/keygen.php
# keep the secret half out of the repository (CI reads it from the
# RELEASE_SIGNING_KEY secret), and put the public half here.
